recover: caught bad
rethrow: again!
finally: catch inside finally
after: done
pending-fulfilled: pending ok
pending-fallthrough-fulfilled: fallthrough done
pending-rejected: pending caught bad
pending-fallthrough-rejected: fallthrough caught fall bad
pending-finally-rejected: final bad R
pending-finally-fallthrough-rejected: fall final bad Rr
pending-finally-fulfilled: pending finally ok RrF
pending-finally-fallthrough-fulfilled: finally fallthrough done RrFf
